# @hub-lanes

# ── ARCHIE OVERLOOKER LANE (BH-5562) ────────────────────────────────────────
# Every 15 minutes (8 past, off the staff tick's minute) bin/archie-overlook.sh
# checks the staff agents with no model call. An agent with 25 same-class
# actions or 10 filings in one UTC day gets flags/staff-off-<agent> and one warn
# beat. A staff fingerprint on two or more open issues is one warn beat; the
# GitHub lists run only after a new filing. On Monday (UTC) Archie sends one
# weekly staff report through his own beat gate. flock -n dedupes. Off:
# ARCHIE_OVERLOOK_ENABLED=0, flags/lane-off-archie-overlook, or
# bin/harness-ctl.sh off archie-overlook.
8-58/15 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/archie-overlook.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
